title: 'statement-store: keep the routing peers reserved on the v2 DHT path'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    With the v2 DHT path on, peer steering keeps the node's routing peers reserved besides the
    peers covering its topics: the `replication_factor` nearest known peers, then the nearest
    peer of every distance bucket from the node's key that they leave uncovered.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
